<h2 class="page-section-title">How It Works</h2>
<div class="steps">
  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-num">1</div>
    <div>
      <h3>Email Your Insurance Card</h3>
      <p>Send a photo or copy of your insurance card before your first appointment so we can verify your coverage ahead of time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-num">2</div>
    <div>
      <h3>We Verify Your Coverage</h3>
      <p>For in-network plans, we handle verification and billing directly on your behalf — you focus on your treatment, we handle the paperwork.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-num">3</div>
    <div>
      <h3>Superbill If Out-of-Network</h3>
      <p>If you're out-of-network, we provide a Superbill so you can file a claim directly with your insurer for reimbursement.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-num">4</div>
    <div>
      <h3>Enjoy Your Session</h3>
      <p>Receive the same personalized, licensed care as any client — your insurance handles the payment, you enjoy the results.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="notice-box">
  <h3>A Few Honest Notes on Coverage</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>We are currently in the process of credentialing with additional insurance providers — call us to check where things stand with your specific plan.</li>
    <li>Even with in-network status, individual plans may have restrictions such as visit limits, prior authorization requirements, or referral needs.</li>
    <li>While we attempt to verify your benefits beforehand, your insurance company makes the final payment determination.</li>
    <li>Out-of-network patients receive a Superbill to self-submit for reimbursement.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
